config OPLUS_SENSOR_DEVINFO
	bool "OPLUS sensor information for the SLPI"
	depends on QCOM_SMEM && OF
	help
	  The sensor drivers of the OPLUS SLPI firmware read the sensor
	  configuration from the SMEM_SENSOR entry, which this driver fills
	  from the oplus,sensor-devinfo devicetree node. It must run before
	  the SLPI boots, so it can only be built in.
